{{!
    @template local_oksigeniaeguahe/panel_entry_row

    An entry in a list: what kind it is (its icon and its name in words), its name for the team, open or closed, how
    many families it brought as a bar on the scale of the list and the number written, when the last one came, the
    places it is shared from, or what is missing to start. The name is the link, stretched to the row.

    New in this round: kindname, icon, open, statetext, n, broughttext, hasn, v, hassites. Kept: name, last, missing,
    sites, url.

    Example context (json):
    {"i": {"der": ""}, "name": "Pidan información", "kindname": "Formulario", "icon": "", "open": true, "statetext": "Abierta",
        "n": 23, "broughttext": "23 familias", "hasn": true, "v": 0.6, "last": "la última, ayer a las 21:14", "missing": "",
        "sites": ["Instagram"], "hassites": true, "url": "#"}
}}
<div class="entrada-fila{{^open}} cerrada{{/open}}">
    <span class="tipo-entrada" aria-hidden="true">{{{icon}}}</span>
    <span class="que">
        <a class="nombres" href="{{url}}">{{name}}</a>
        <span class="secundario">{{kindname}} · <span class="estado-entrada">{{statetext}}</span></span>
        {{#hassites}}<span class="sitios-l">{{#sites}}<span class="dato contorno">{{.}}</span>{{/sites}}</span>{{/hassites}}
        {{#missing}}<span class="falta">{{missing}}</span>{{/missing}}
    </span>
    <span class="cuantas">
        <span class="barra-entrada" aria-hidden="true">{{#hasn}}<i style="--v: {{v}}"></i>{{/hasn}}</span>
        <b>{{broughttext}}</b><span class="secundario">{{last}}</span>
    </span>
</div>
